  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Pretty Plum Boutique is here to empower women and children of all sizes, to be uniquely themselves, by offering high-quality, handmade, comfortable, beautiful clothing and accessories. Ethically and sustainably made in Canada.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>Our products are made with high-quality fabrics, that are made to last. At Pretty Plum Boutique, we are all about functionality! Our clothing can be put in the regular wash and dry - since parents don't have time for fancy washing instructions. All of our fabrics are Okeo-Tex certified. The majority of our designs are done in-house, and printed in small batches. We also have a curated selection of solids, picked to work with our prints.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>Payments will be made 30 days after the purchase.&nbsp;</p>",
